681..754 Comment "/// Marks on a computation, flushed at the end. Where writes go nowhere a"
755..831 Comment "/// flushed mark leaves nothing, and where the state is kept flushing a mark"
832..906 Comment "/// keeps it. The two overlap at `flush(mark(k))` in the rows holding both"
907..982 Comment "/// `State` and `Sink`; there marks and flushes are erased, so both reducts"
983..997 Comment "/// reach `k`."
